BoardBase <|--- BoardWithUpdatePrivacy
BaseBusinessAssets <|--- BusinessAssets
CatalogsUpdatableCreativeAssetsAttributes <|--- CatalogsCreativeAssetsAttributes
CatalogsUpdatableHotelAttributes <|--- CatalogsHotelAttributes
CatalogsProductGroupUpdateRequest <|--- CatalogsProductGroupUpdateManyRequestItemsOneOfItems0
ConversionTagCommon <|--- ConversionTag
ConversionTag <|--- ConversionTagResponse
UpdatableItemAttributes <|--- ItemAttributes
LeadSubscription <|--- LeadSubscriptionPostParams
LeadSubscriptionCreate <|--- LeadSubscriptionPostParamsCreate
PinBase <|--- Pin
PinBase <|--- PinRead
SSIOInsertionOrderStatus <|--- SSIOInsertionOrderStatusResponse
LocalInventoryOperationResult <|--- SupplementalOperationResult

LocalInventoryItemResponse -- StoreMetadata : store_metadata
CatalogsCreativeAssetsProduct -- CatalogsCreativeAssetsProductMetadata : metadata
CatalogsCreativeAssetsProduct -- Pin : pin
CreateAssetInvitesRequest -- "0..*" CreateAssetInvitesRequestItem : invites
CatalogsHotelReportStatsParameters -- CatalogsHotelReportStatsParametersReport : report
EventData -- LineItem : line_items
KeywordsCreate -- "0..*" KeywordCreateItem : keywords
CustomNumber4Filter -- CatalogsProductGroupUint32Criteria : CUSTOM_NUMBER_4
GoogleProductCategory4Filter -- CatalogsProductGroupMultipleStringListCriteria : GOOGLE_PRODUCT_CATEGORY_4
KeywordError -- Keyword : data
Audience -- AudienceRule : rule
AdAccountsAudienceUpdate -- AdAccountsAudienceRule : rule
SummaryPin -- PinMedia : media
TargetingTemplate -- "0..*" TargetingTemplateKeyword : keywords
